# Current, time and electrolysis yield
# Hold time at 75 s and order the product inventories made by 0.05 A, 0.1 A,
# 0.2 A and 0.4 A. Connect the order to charge Q = I t; current alone is not
# a yield law when time is allowed to change.
register lv3
add v1 water 250mL
add v1 Na2SO4 0.001mol
electrolyse v1 0.05A 75s
inspect v1
new
add v2 water 250mL
add v2 Na2SO4 0.001mol
electrolyse v2 0.1A 75s
inspect v2
new
add v3 water 250mL
add v3 Na2SO4 0.001mol
electrolyse v3 0.2A 75s
inspect v3
new
add v4 water 250mL
add v4 Na2SO4 0.001mol
electrolyse v4 0.4A 75s
inspect v4
